{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"So, thoughts on the final 2 weeks and the direction you have been going v/ where you would like to go?","created_at":"2021-08-02T19:33:51.958000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-02T19:34:06.010000Z","id":"871838229811298475","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"I am still all for hammy burning down end of week 4.  Based on all that crane has been doing, I will likely talk to him soon abotu what he wants to have happen during week four, and his plans for week 5 when there will be nearly no locations/NPCs left in hammy.\n\nWe didnt get to do destruction of the airship port before break, but I know its still slotted for early weeks four.  Likely going to make it a bigger boom, so that we can move players docs to the new location.\n\ndepending on what happens with the heore group, If she dies, Malathor gets the ordinary, and will still buy essances, but Frankensteining players will be taken off the table.  regardless she will die when hammy goes down.\n\nsometime mid to late week 5 when be when the mender makes his exit (this time it wont be a bloody shock).  I kinda like the idea that the last few days, players will have less and less options for rezzing (especially since they are getting revivify much more often).\n\nThats all my major points for hammy.","created_at":"2021-08-02T19:47:15.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871841598466584638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
