{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"Just so yall know.... Mender is taking a draft of the constitution to the local under the bay chinn town... making sure they are aware of the government that will be imposed upon them as well as the other already established nations of arcania, so they can decide to show up to Liberty Hall and at least be heard.  He will try his hardest to not influence their stance while bringing up the various comments and concerns he heard.  He will leave it to them to decide if they want to let the other nations know, or even get involved.  But he remembers how the locals felt when Roanoke was founded, how much they hated us taking their lands, and thus feels they should at least be alerted as to what is happening.","created_at":"2021-08-13T13:05:01.091000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875726639584149554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
