{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779735780491276","content":"<@&851447922301730836> Crane wont be here tonight.  Anyone wanna run a mission blowing up the airship port?  All youd need to know is: Redcoat supply lines and troops move in and out through the port, so, get through 3 checkpoints, plant bombs in control room.  Players can sneak, talk, or shoot their way to the control room.  Then escape.  Once destroyed, Radar has a plan to move the docks to Governors Island.","created_at":"2021-08-15T19:53:37.432000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876554244302442516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
